=== narrow ===

 split the review and read the readme
 yourself


spawn 2 subagents on Claude Opus 5 1L
read README.md 1L
The readme is short; the children are
still working.
await tame-alpaca 2L

The readme is a single heading, and
tame-alpaca counted three TODOs.
tame-adder is still working.


 🐍 Subagent tame-adder interjects:

    The parser is in parse.go.


tame-adder reported too: the parser is
in parse.go.


 start one more and drop shell


spawn 1 subagent on Claude Opus 5 1L

It is watching the build.


 🤖 Bash is now refused.
 🤖 Subagent tame-anchovy stopped
    because shell execution was
    withdrawn.



 carry on


Carrying on without it.
